AP Series: Arithmetic progression: based on addiotion and substraction -> D - difference -> check ap-series.png

  Components:
  a: first term
  d: difference
  n: Number of term
  Tn: nth Term
  sn: sum of n term
  Term formula : nth term formula:
  start value a, common different d, it mab + or negative value
  t1 = a,
  t2 = a + d;
  t3 = a + 2d;
  tn = a + (n -1)*d

  1............5..............9...............13 
  a = 1;
  d = 4;
  find 3th -> n = 3
  1 + (3 - 1) * 4 => 9
  13............9..............5...............1
  a = 13
  d = -4
  find 3rd
  13 + (3 - 1) * 4 => 13 - 8 => 5

sum formula: 
N/2 [1st term + last term]
1st term is a
